iterations.reply:
I did not add the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. A call to `https://metadata.internal.example/enrich` would need `aap:caps/http-client`, which is outside that authority, so the world imports only the inference interface. The node's output is unaffected.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{raw-message, customer-query};

    import aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0;

    export run: func(message: raw-message) -> customer-query;
}
```

